    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I find mathematics fascinating yet challenging—like a puzzle where every piece connects to reveal deeper patterns. It’s both an intellectual hobby and something I return to for problem-solving in my part-time job. While equations feel daunting initially, the satisfaction of cracking them feels rewarding.",
